# What the deploy uploads, and what it has no business uploading.
#
# Without this file the CLI sends the whole working directory — 226MB of it,
# of which References alone is 719MB on disk — and the deploy fails outright:
# dronediverterdeployment.MOV is 138MB against Vercel's 100MB per-file limit.
# .gitignore already keeps the heavy footage out of the history, but the CLI
# does not read it, so the same list has to be stated here.

# Stock footage kept locally for reference only. The frames actually used are
# committed under public/assets and ship with the build; nothing here is ever
# served, and it is the reason a deploy failed rather than merely being slow.
References

# Generated single-file snapshots — rebuild with scripts/build_preview.py.
# Each is 10-15MB of inlined data URIs and none of them is a route.
preview

# Built on Vercel, not here. A local build is stale by definition and would
# only be overwritten.
.next
out

# Never useful anywhere.
.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo
